# ── SPARDA artifacts / large binaries ──
# IMPORTANT: ANCHOR these to the repo root with a leading slash.
# A bare `models/` (no leading slash) matches ANY directory named `models`
# anywhere in the tree — that bug swallowed DANTE's `models/` package source.
# Keep the leading slash so only the top-level artifact dirs are ignored.
/models/
/indices/
/artifacts/
/data/raw/
*.gguf
*.faiss
*.index
*.pkl
*.npy
*.gpickle
